{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_title", "source_sha256": "169b0282e5b82961adfa9ed6b3a87cc5b2b7afc03d2d1b15161d9b2c40b5f735", "ja": "そして、少女は羽化する", "zh": "而后，少女羽化成蝶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_synopsis", "source_sha256": "74cd038ab2efbfa71bc8619aa0a976790ae27bc3eb4ae3070f765aa020b70f01", "ja": "可憐なモデル仕事を終えたばかりの真に、\n少年役でのドラマの出演依頼が届く。可愛い\nイメージが広まったばかりなのにと心配する\nプロデューサー。自分の魅力について考えた\n真は、そのドラマの出演を引き受ける。", "zh": "刚结束了楚楚可怜的模特工作的真，\n收到了在电视剧中出演少年角色的邀请。真可爱的\n形象才刚传开，制作人对此有些担心。\n而思考了自身魅力的真，\n接下了那部电视剧的出演工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1000_p", "source_sha256": "49750ec1f53ccabecb3d3f50a4a2222d0ce0b5ec9a5f15d3aa615f9cfdf23377", "ja": "（真がモデルを務める『Whitelilac』の\n最新号の撮影風景が、公式のSNSで公開された）", "zh": "（真担任模特的《Whitelilac》最新一期拍摄花絮，在官方社交账号上公开了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fc00fb1da1864a9bcdd7c8eefc53bdc229131e3e6e8fae2f7238f7f8e458be6c", "ja": "（妖精姿の真は、ファンの人達以外の間でも\n「この美少女は誰？」と話題になっている……）", "zh": "（穿着妖精装扮的真，除了粉丝之外，也在其他人之间引起了“这个美少女是谁？”的热议……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2c7ff033159258a60f876f6e2bdb5a371907810e2010619eef53fddc3e377e73", "ja": "う～ん、どうしたものか……。\n何はともあれ、真本人に相談してみるか……。", "zh": "嗯～该怎么办才好呢……\n不管怎样，还是先去和真本人商量一下吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "77055cd17b966a7c2d060e8065203d4318d396bfc76ca3c352edf6efdbe53edf", "ja": "えへへ……えへへへ～っ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "d7ab3a8d8bdb952da355f940f5dd515ebdfb640d19365e7801a42fab9035c8c3", "ja": "あっ、それって、真ちゃんがモデルをした写真？\nえっ……この写真が、そうなの！？", "zh": "啊，那是小真当模特拍的照片吗？\n诶……这张照片就是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "3cc3feb603f3529f56d533404c23c138747360c333569d15f4fe931d8e0dbac6", "ja": "そうだよ！　自分で言うのもなんだけど、\nなんだかボクじゃないみたいな気がしちゃって。", "zh": "没错！虽然这么说有点自夸，\n但总觉得照片里的自己好像不是我一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "4126f58406dbdbe4dd831c88dbf30002f14a49cf6b69d6ccd570d43bb46d84dc", "ja": "わぁ……なまらステキな写真だねえ。\nほんとに、本物の妖精さんがいるみたいだべさ！", "zh": "哇……这张照片漂亮得不得了呢。简直就像真的有精灵在里面一样呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "289a18fe7cdf98a1c57b13acb4826a1603599e3502d2851cd852d690d839a281", "ja": "うん、真さん本当に本物の妖精さんみたい！\n……あっ！　もしかして本当に妖精さんだったとか！？", "zh": "嗯，真真的好像真正的精灵！\n……啊！难道真的是精灵不成！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "265c6046e9397b8455093d858e67032ffc4dd7d3b5d1289ea3322075efcb5f47", "ja": "未来ちゃん、未来ちゃん。\nいくらなんでも、それはないと思うのです。", "zh": "未来，未来。\n再怎么说，我觉得那也不可能吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "a9246b6e2e2dfc1966fdec985fba212001d215329ee76684102d1c65305ffb7b", "ja": "でも、未来がそう思っちゃうのも仕方ないかも。\nそれくらい、幻想的で素敵な写真……。", "zh": "不过，未来会那么想，或许也情有可原。\n毕竟那张照片梦幻得令人惊叹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "f7231a13d5c619cfbd1b5c7a34d3ab7463a86424c7edd8ecaf0f2a1b282b017f", "ja": "も、もう……琴葉もひなたも、未来もまつりも！\nみんな褒めすぎだってば！　えへ、えへへ……♪", "zh": "好、好了……琴叶、日向、未来，还有茉莉！  \n你们也太会夸人了吧！嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "1c30d5f3c2b7948aa19303155407095ddfb375df50ec89897d28419764b1346c", "ja": "真さん、いい顔してるべさ。\n雑誌の撮影は、楽しかったかい？", "zh": "真，你的表情真好看呢。杂志拍摄开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "fb1a0f44f35dbfcb772384b6e154145601882bab672eeb8f423f8f3b8e58baf5", "ja": "うん、すごく楽しかったよ！　メイクさんや\nスタイリストさんが、魔法使いみたいでさ……！", "zh": "嗯，特别开心哦！化妆师和\n造型师就像魔法师一样呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1013_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e08f4f70525ed45c8e090aaa5679e7cd8d6e40915bc9730b40b58321e121ac9c", "ja": "真……あ、みんなも揃ってたのか。\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "真……啊，原来大家都到齐了。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "24be5a61b1b5b56d15784bacc360add5d0d561bc2e939621328e54017ad04b42", "ja": "あっ。\nお疲れさまです、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊。\n您辛苦了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "2a5f7fa1c6d3c0c4230288d1b0fc3cc30a0627ede4b8aa7f7c21abe11833e0e9", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、もう見たのです？\n真ちゃんの写真！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也已经看过了吗？\n真拍的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ed11df9a057b8f5227ca736e8fb52cb1f32f644157039f07b6cb45cb24170c56", "ja": "え？　ああ、もちろん。\n雑誌の発売が楽しみだな。楽しみだけど……。", "zh": "嗯？啊，当然看过了。\n真要登的杂志，我很期待。虽然很期待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "7f385355b78933acbcdfa5c0216bc2bc9be75bc32c283e891d6bf9ece14ba2a0", "ja": "{$P$}……？\nあの～。難しい顔して、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}……？\n那个～。您愁眉苦脸的，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "538681d1a0659d00ba201adda49a70a80ebe07e25b76019f396d8cd7b0d6ce3c", "ja": "撮影、けっこう上手くいったと思ったんですけど……\n何か問題がありましたか？", "zh": "我觉得这次拍摄进行得挺顺利的……  \n是出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6d1abec2f142b9f484ea618da2fbdec4a91f1ac6e278bf2aa38ac6dea8a39840", "ja": "いや、問題じゃないんだ。……実は、その写真を\n見たっていう人から、仕事のオファーがあったんだ。", "zh": "不，不是有问题。……其实是有人看了\n那张照片，发来了工作邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "5d365935b89c57b5c5429dc623bd24d8fd61c7b0bb1215fef61ea5663dfa0026", "ja": "ええっ！？　ほ、本当ですか！？", "zh": "诶！？真、真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "2558e8e84080c81b0ae279ec44ba94285ecd04ff188a0f4a418a3ac2ae82d51f", "ja": "わぁ……さっそく、新しいお仕事かい？\nやっぱし、真さんはすごいねぇ！", "zh": "哇……这么快就有新工作了吗？\n真姐姐果然好厉害呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1afb74add57814fcd9e898431e9f156adfc3ff20ea1d382941f6fd04b402b73e", "ja": "そうだな。これも、真が頑張った結果だと思う。\nそれで、その新しい仕事の内容なんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得这也是小真努力的成果。\n那么，关于这份新工作的内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "11c866a1b5bbdbe603636c4a12467a09fc71ca78eb3a4e4a6b78a8515c332d55", "ja": "お仕事の内容に、何か問題があるんですか？", "zh": "工作内容有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "f74ff541161462f35e2eb8f805fc062aec84c4066bd26fcf6aaddebeb7499c50", "ja": "むう……{$P$}さん！　ちゃんと\nお話してくれないと、ちっともわからないのですよ？", "zh": "唔……{$P$}先生！　你不好好\n跟我说清楚的话，我可一点都不明白哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1026_p", "source_sha256": "914d10339a8ee5abc1c5b6e92826e6dabe3efd85e8586628205747b385afd492", "ja": "ああ、ごめん。\nそうだな。ちゃんと話さないとな。", "zh": "啊，对不起。\n是啊，得好好说明才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1a1464f82fa71d787bab441512d6a88ca3cc7205fc221ef1118705b008ea5c1f", "ja": "今回、真にきた依頼というのは、『りるきゃん』で\n連載してる少女漫画原作の、ドラマの主演だ。", "zh": "这次，找真来出演的委托，是担任根据《りるきゃん》连载的少女漫画改编的电视剧主演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f1be2584e52d5ce4fb8637af079efa5930a849c2a9d077eb1402630f91612081", "ja": "内容は、原作のスピンオフという事なんだけど……\n登場する男の子、2人のうちの1人の話だ。", "zh": "内容是原作的衍生作品……讲的是登场男生中2人里的1人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "4761f4c7e2b514eede145d6578ccf8e5a87230a3886dfd7ab3d40a2b4c8616f8", "ja": "ええ！？\nそれって、もしかして……。", "zh": "诶！？\n难道那是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0cccab761120b3c47a0483ea6298f42170844b4210b5e09fd82cb6a133d3222f", "ja": "うん。この前、真達が控え室で読んでた、\n『キミさけ』のカケル役だそうだ。", "zh": "嗯。听说是真她们之前在休息室读的《キミさけ》里的阿翔一角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "c78804373a08ca31a5f0aba1814cb38bbe61e44f9010e10883e87e81ea0aca1a", "ja": "カケル役を……ボクが！？", "zh": "饰演翔……由我来！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd665edc749eff079b432cba0191eaeed3b0becea156d1e03a9cb78a28cc963c", "ja": "真さんが、『キミさけ』のカケル君！？\nすごい……！", "zh": "真同学是《キミさけ》里的阿翼！？  \n好厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5474f43790c00042366dab908aa65ed3a9c46e0c0e28641d0971b78af2743edf", "ja": "うん。先方も散々オーディションしたんだけど、\nイメージに合う役者が見つからなかったそうだ。", "zh": "嗯。对方虽然办了很久的试镜，\n但据说一直没找到符合形象的演员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1035_p", "source_sha256": "99d12eb350d6f2edcd3f2c3e0a759b0b88c060e1fed8a4781c4a5d1c2622d400", "ja": "そこに今朝、原作者の先生がSNSで真の写真を見て、\nピンときたらしい。それで、連絡がきたんだよ。", "zh": "今天早上，原作者老师在社交平台上看到了真子的照片，似乎一下子就有了灵感。所以，他们联系过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1036_021mat", "source_sha256": "aa719966d4b69d8f321c02d5f39ae2fe6603b9aeac2f7e77401b3d25b4ce752a", "ja": "さすが、原作者の先生は見る目が違うのです！\n妖精さんな真ちゃんは、カケル君にピッタリなのです！", "zh": "不愧是原作者老师，眼光就是不一样！像小精灵一样的小真，和Kakeru简直太合适了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "f91e745ef0580e8a24212cad0d4f5a079578a3c8fc2cd6e988fe6b9e74c2b9e7", "ja": "でも、この写真の真さん、とっても綺麗だけども……\nそれなのに、お仕事は男の子の役なのかい？", "zh": "不过，照片里的真小姐确实非常漂亮，可是……\n即便如此，工作还是要演男孩子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1038_p", "source_sha256": "93d4dc624b8dd40ff2cf14669bc04a37fff3e33f8a03e100b315e8d4d7ae54b0", "ja": "そうなんだ。少女漫画のヒーローだし……\n中性的な雰囲気のある役者を探していたんだそうだ。", "zh": "是这样的。毕竟是少女漫画的男主角……\n听说他们正在寻找气质中性的演员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1039_p", "source_sha256": "d013db11d25521175bcfe2c754b596128dae372210fb9b73c2ed1443abccf292", "ja": "でも、可愛い仕事をしたばかりだろう？\nイメージを考えると、男の子役は真逆だし……。", "zh": "不过，你刚做完可爱的工作吧？\n考虑到形象，男孩子的角色可是完全相反的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "6dd54043a28cfa87c92027f123efb5ee1eef46bb04a75e1eda8d1d76a0f5deec", "ja": "かわいさを、打ち消しかねないですもんね……。\nそれで、悩んでいたんですか？", "zh": "毕竟可能会抵消可爱形象嘛……\n所以，你就是因为这个烦恼的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1041_p", "source_sha256": "976b43b9ae97b7105383d0a74d49c7d6603fc9ca553a5e5bfa3dbd3829d33fe5", "ja": "ああ。ただ、判断をするにも、\n真の意見を聞いてからにしようと思って……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，我想还是先听听真怎么想，再做决定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1042_p", "source_sha256": "60e2e25b01e88dba20ce66733811e607a2abbbe5218faa234fe81fa79badf7f7", "ja": "真、どうする？　……どうしたい？", "zh": "真，你打算怎么办？……你想怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "71a346bce17e82519c5f0923234c1d7e18a0a01ddba89d99ef8b12a60fe0ab5f", "ja": "{$P$}……\nボクは……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1044_006mak", "source_sha256": "7db0470c6c8eaa2c40851f0141c4153117c88502209cfd1d6c7479449ad09f67", "ja": "ボクは…………\nボク、そのドラマに出たいです！", "zh": "我…………\n\n我想出演那部电视剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "5b0e9d53bfbb1892976df6f5c94ba212c759ebe606a30c174589c83146ff1bb3", "ja": "真ちゃん？", "zh": "小真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1047_p", "source_sha256": "cea3957c3dc65429de8756c2f3fcecbf63099921ac921a4631143dfdd77b9aa6", "ja": "真……。", "zh": "真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1048_006mak", "source_sha256": "5008c9f5eb27f8c7f517ca05dc5e0618214af89d69c6dedd285b6f4c01d5725e", "ja": "だって主演なんて、すごいチャンスじゃないですか！\nしかも、超人気漫画『キミさけ』のドラマ化ですよ！？", "zh": "因为这可是主演的机会，难道不是很棒的机遇吗！\n而且还是将超人气漫画《キミさけ》改编成电视剧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "24bc6157b73a4d78bbe04637175fa1c82ab075b8ec7dc5a71b5aeb9f8c93a4d2", "ja": "これって、絶対に話題になると思うんです！\nだからボク、やりたいです！", "zh": "我觉得这部剧绝对会成为话题！\n所以我想演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1050_p", "source_sha256": "290cecb29ae32c303a69fddecf350e189a1145ee543d3703fe88e606866e21d6", "ja": "いいのか？　ドラマが話題になれば、\nせっかくの可愛いイメージが薄れるかもしれない。", "zh": "这样好吗？如果电视剧成了热门话题，\n难得树立起来的可爱形象可能会变淡哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "59b8e5c698e587ec1a2ce0666908a8215361ff947b30958f916f562f46a59524", "ja": "なに言ってるんですか、{$P$}！\nむしろ、ガンガン話題になりましょう！", "zh": "你在说什么呢，{$P$}！\n不如说，就该大大方方地成为话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1052_006mak", "source_sha256": "b74b08f27be34b863fdfcc5d8ef047c9896eff3e73b13b93a117fffa355ec71a", "ja": "だってボク、アイドルですからね！\nこんなチャンス、逃す手はありませんよ！", "zh": "因为我可是偶像啊！\n这种机会，当然不能错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "5c619d9471e41ed7275f068c8516abb747473b6b6626bb1e0ac7cae54efe45f3", "ja": "それに原作の先生は、『Whitelilac』の\n写真を見て、ボクを選んでくれたんですよね？", "zh": "而且原作的作者也是看了《Whitelilac》的照片后，才选中我的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "5738e687c45db01572866ebed56fa4c10b02b64a4abbd3d6291581e8796702a8", "ja": "そっか……カッコいい真ちゃんじゃなくて、\nかわいい真ちゃんだから選ばれたってことは……。", "zh": "原来如此……不是因为帅气的真，而是因为可爱的真才被选中，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1055_017kth", "source_sha256": "126efc0d0e72e7ab95efe8301d2e73932462b1a6147b8b42d2c8d16f3bef3440", "ja": "求められているのは、男の子っぽさじゃないですよね。\nだとすると……透明感……？", "zh": "被需要的并不是男孩子气，对吧。\n这么说来……是通透感……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1056_p", "source_sha256": "743e484817f403548e889ea4aaf17c861d0ee2e730253fcd54dea59b03b6cf9e", "ja": "透明感か……\n確かに、真の魅力を表すのにぴったりだ。", "zh": "透明感啊……\n确实，非常适合用来形容真魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1057_021mat", "source_sha256": "6e9b406f60e9421812cebd40f42bd5ccd5154133163f9ea0f7cf2c34435793b7", "ja": "そのとおりなのです、琴葉ちゃん！\n姫には、よくわかるのです……。", "zh": "正是如此，琴叶！\n公主非常明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1058_014mir", "source_sha256": "d65ad27dd804b34b2cfe086cbd8463042fea9e5065b13b30d59df4a176adefd1", "ja": "まつりちゃん？", "zh": "茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1059_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad82ff55276a46b34f41f3db13e39d41eacf0b1053341e6d4be8117d4776f33e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、わからないのです？\n少女漫画のヒーローは、みんなの憧れなのですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您不明白吗？\n少女漫画里的男主角，都是大家憧憬的对象哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1060_021mat", "source_sha256": "bbc651271868f223df6745c7015a23326e1aed165d5c435d5fe4d921275a8f47", "ja": "つまり、カケル君はアイドルなのです！\n妖精さんな真ちゃんに、ピッタリなのです！", "zh": "也就是说，Kakeru同学就是偶像！  \n对妖精般的小真来说，再合适不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1061_035hin", "source_sha256": "5fa021dace55d6ec05e582e78ac59e8d3cf9c421d64bd88d9bc53962525f1d62", "ja": "まつり姫さんのいうとおりかもしれないねぇ。\n妖精さんな真さんは、なまらステキだったし。", "zh": "茉莉公主说得或许没错呢。\n小妖精一样的真小姐，真的特别棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1062_006mak", "source_sha256": "ae7804e14b5046f12144ec03b0e0f09d5fd11da4b4a481c5c18e1402cee5e2e9", "ja": "みんな……。", "zh": "大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1063_p", "source_sha256": "b488e083d012a09a8ec6c0702a2d7d5fc05200750df546581262c194a369c261", "ja": "つまり真の魅力は、可愛い部分とカッコいい部分を\n併せ持ったもの……そういう事だな。", "zh": "也就是说，真正的魅力就是兼具可爱与帅气的一面……是这个意思吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1064_006mak", "source_sha256": "8affa0ebe2af2ab664b285e8f20334c05264426ce7d4bad7299e2ca83d3131c3", "ja": "はいっ！　って、自分で魅力なんて言うの、\n照れちゃいますけどね。えへへ。", "zh": "是！要自己说魅力什么的，还是会有点不好意思啦。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1065_p", "source_sha256": "755e83ddbe7c7b2babb066e38566c79b2c0bdfa36f955b781c4ff431d8281f4e", "ja": "よし。ドラマの話は、進めておこう。\n公演の準備もあって大変だけど、乗り越えような！", "zh": "好。电视剧的事，我就先推进下去了。\n虽然还要准备公演会很辛苦，但一起克服难关吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1066_006mak", "source_sha256": "9e35ba3597fd53128409185166ef833cf4e2e724678c155e79e66b041576e0c2", "ja": "安心してください、{$P$}！\n劇場には、頼もしい仲間がいますからね！", "zh": "请放心吧，{$P$}！\n剧场里可还有可靠的同伴在呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1067_035hin", "source_sha256": "39722999fb3dff0b07b3b70a1fcf94a13214de6ae7a6fab1c123bb5b830cdc0c", "ja": "頼もしいなんて、ちょっこし恥ずかしいけど……\nお手伝いできるように、一生懸命がんばるべさ。", "zh": "被说可靠，总觉得有点不好意思……不过为了能帮上忙，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1068_014mir", "source_sha256": "b30cfc37cf493f18cbc90d46d88c578ad5e9cf18724f05a89461d40185597d35", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、私も手伝うよ！", "zh": "日向，我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1069_014mir", "source_sha256": "5bb27396828e1574a05abd0910fb60a94a4dcec071186f54f3d434593515dd53", "ja": "かわいい真さんも、カッコいい真さんも、\nみんなに、いーっぱい見てもらいたいもん♪", "zh": "可爱的真同学也好，帅气的真同学也好，\n我都想让大家好好看看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1070_017kth", "source_sha256": "91b62d593bf05412ba8e5ab78b7bf3027c72ac0c85e8b1b84894a2b4810f19af", "ja": "未来……そうだね。いろんなお客さんに、\n楽しんでもらえる公演にしようね！", "zh": "未来……嗯，说得对。我们要办一场让各种各样的客人都能尽兴的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1071_021mat", "source_sha256": "abb140e5d88e55fba3097c51a78852abdfe3db27cb51af59e065608c16294163", "ja": "みんなの気持ちは、ひとつなのです！\n真ちゃんの公演、絶対に成功させるのです♪", "zh": "大家的心意，已经合为一体了呢！\n真小姐的公演，绝对要办得顺顺利利哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_061_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_061_1072_006mak", "source_sha256": "1c7dc1402fb623e2537937b332a50c260a6bab6a89db7a0267820b6d1e27e326", "ja": "ありがとう、みんな！　……って、もうこんな時間！？\nそろそろレッスンを再開しようか！", "zh": "谢谢大家！……等等，已经这么晚了！？\n差不多该继续练习了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
